      "content": "intense sensations? i dont know. i feel like i've tried everything. i go to the gym, i travel, i hang out with friends... nothing works. it's like there's a wall between me and the actual world. no matter what i do, i'm just watching it happen from behind a screen. it's just so exhausting to keep pretending everything is okay when it's actually just... nothing.",
